  sceneName: Mountain_river_valley
  text: Mirage is an immersive experience for living in the moment. Inhale and exhale
    with the guidance from our experts to experience the breath of life. Watch the
    graceful swan fly along the mountains in Sanka, Nepal, fluttering to your heart
    rate. Receive active biofeedback from your heart as a response to your breathing.
    Choose the preset levels of immersion or pick your own settings.
